        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahahana urubibe n’intara ya Yuda, hazoba ari ahantu hateguriwe igikorwa kidasanzwe. Hazoba hangana ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’ibilometero 13.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " vy’uburebure, ubwaguke bwaho na bwo buzova ku rubibe rwa Isirayeli mu buseruko, rushike mu burengero nk’uko intara z’imiryango zimeze. Ingoro yanje izoba hagati muri ico kibanza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umugabane wera muzoha ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " uzoba ufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu z’uburebure hamwe n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko igihumbi z’ubwaguke",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’ibilometero 5,3.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umugabane wera muzoha abaherezi uzogira uburebure bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu z’uburebure n’ibihumbi icumi vy’ubwaguke ku ruhande rwo mu burengero. Ingoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " izoba hagati na hagati muri wo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo uzoba uw’abaherezi bejejwe, bakomoka kuri Sadoki, bankoreye mu bwizigirwa, batantaye nk’Abalewi igihe Abisirayeli banta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzobe umugabane wabo udasanzwe, ukuwe ku mugabane wejejwe wo muri ico gihugu, umugabane wera cane, uhana urubibe n’intara y’Abalewi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalewi bazohabwa intara ihana urubibe n’umugabane w’abaherezi, hazoba hangana ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu z’uburebure n’ibihumbi icumi vy’ubwaguke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntibazohagurishe canke ngo bagire ico bahakaba. Ntihazohabwe abandi kuko ari isi nziza cane, kandi hakaba herejwe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasigaye hangana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi bitanu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’ibilometero 2,7.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " z’uburebure, n’ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu vy’ubwaguke hazohabwa Abisirayeli, bahubake amazu hongere habe uburagiro, igisagara kibe hagati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico gisagara kizoba gipima ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi bine n’amajana atanu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’imetero 2,4.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ku ruhande rwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uburagiro buzogire ingero z’igice c’ukuboko amajana abiri na mirongo itanu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’imetero 135.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ku mpande zine zabwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasigaye, hahana urubibe n’umugabane wera, hazoba hafise uburebure bungana n’ubw’uwo mugabane wera, hazoba hafise uburebure bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi icumi n’ubwaguke bw’ibihumbi icumi nyene. Indimiro zaho zizovamwo ivyokurya vy’abakora mu gisagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abazoba bakora mu gisagara barima izo ndimiro, bazoba bava mu miryango yose ya Isirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo mugabane wera wose uzoba ufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu uruhande rwose. Muzowutoranye nk’ingabire idasanzwe, hamwe n’ahubatse igisagara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasigaye ku mpande zompi z’umugabane wera n’igisagara, hazobe ah’umwami. Hazongana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na zitanu kuva ku mugabane wera uja mu buseruko, n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na zitanu kuva ku mugabane wera uja mu burengero. Iyo migabane yose uko ari ibiri, izoba ihana urubibe rurerure n’imigabane yahawe imiryango, izoba iy’umwami; kandi umugabane wera hamwe n’urusengero bizoba hagati na hagati y’aho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero umugabane w’Abalewi uzoba ugizwe n’ahantu hose hari hagati y’intara ya Yuda n’intara ya Benyamini, ukuyemwo ahatoranirijwe kuba umugabane wera n’igisagara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi kuva ico gihe, izina ry’ico gisagara rizobe iri: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni ho ari.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
